Rev 9:1 , At the sounding of the fifth angel, a star falls from heaven, to whom is given the key to the bottomless pit;
Rev 9:2 , He opens the pit, and there come forth locusts like scorpions;
Rev 9:12 , The first woe past;
Rev 9:13 , The sixth trumpet sounds;
Rev 9:14 , Four angels are let loose, that were bound.
